# Omni with all-8-bit attention (E4M3 QK^T and PV on the 128-token pair kernel) and the dense prefix on FlashAttention-4
# in E4M3.
# Measured 2026-11-07, production compose, warmup on, 6 clips: 14.90 s per clip (1 image reference); teacher-forced error vs BF16 Omni
# 0.2309 / 0.1171 (video / audio). Before the dense prefix this profile ran 18.02 s at 0.229 / 0.117; omni-fast
# (E4M3 PV only) is 15.28 s at 0.2249 / 0.1179.
#   docker compose --env-file profiles/omni-max.env up -d omni
OMNI_FP8_ATTN=1
OMNI_DENSE_PREFIX=fp8
